  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Pulse V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Pulse V aims to provide timely data on Kosovo&apos;s institutional and socio-economic stability, serving as a vital tool for analyzing social cohesion and development efforts. It will gauge public satisfaction with executive, legislative, and judicial institutions, alongside trends in democratization, economic development, environmental concerns, and social acceptance. The project will employ disaggregation by gender, age, ethnicity, and other relevant dimensions. The objectives include continuing data collection, research, and analysis; Public Pulse V will actively engage Kosovo institutions to advocate for data-driven policy development.</narrative>
  </description>
